      "title": "Over-Smoothing Problem",
      "classification": "substantive",
      "coverage": "pending",
      "text": [
        "Over-Smoothing Problem",
        "• In a deep MPNN, node representations can become",
        "similar (smoothed out) and weaken influence of graph",
        "structure.",
        "• In principal, this can be fixed by choosing message",
        "passing functions that do not act as low-pass filters",
        "and is independent of the topology."
      ],
      "media_sha256": [
        "c845c7befa451bca7bbd34a1b46ea09ae52a74504539686359496462d301f40c"
      ],
      "notes": ""
