      "classification": "substantive",
      "coverage": "pending",
      "text": [
        "Over-Squashing Problem",
        "• Depending on the graph-topology, the size of the 𝑟-hop",
        "of a node may grow exponentially.",
        "• As messages are sent through the ‘same structural edges’",
        "via fixed-size node representations, we lose information."
